slowhttptest
------------------------------------------
SlowHTTPTest is a highly configurable tool that simulates some Application
Layer Denial of Service attacks by prolonging HTTP connections in different
ways.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/shekyan/slowhttptest

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/shekyan/slowhttptest/archive/refs/tags/v1.10.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack slowhttptest-1.10.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./slowhttptest-1.10.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/slowhttptest-1.10.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/slowhttptest-1.10.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(slowhttptest)
  /usr/bin/slowhttptest.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/slowhttptest.README
  /usr/share/doc/slowhttptest/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/slowhttptest/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/slowhttptest/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/slowhttptest.1.gz

